! A 48-species reduced mechanism for NH3/DME/air
!
! Developed by:
! LSS, OVGU, Magdeburg
! https://www.lss.ovgu.de/
!
! Detailed mechanism: 
! Issayev, G., Giri, B. R., Elbaz, A. M., Shrestha, K. P., Mauss, F., Roberts, W. L., & Farooq, A. (2022). Ignition delay time and laminar flame speed measurements of ammonia blended with dimethyl !ether: a promising low carbon fuel blend. Renewable Energy, 181, 1353-1370.
!
!
ELEMENTS
C H O N AR 
HE 
END
SPECIES
AR HE N2 H O
OH H2 O2 HO2 H2O2 
H2O CO CO2 HCO CH2O
CH3 CH4 HOCHO CH3O C2H6 
CH3OH CH3O2 CH3OCH3-DME CH3OCH2 CH3OCH2O2 
CH3OCH2O2H CH3OCH2O CH3OCO CH2OCH2O2H O2CH2OCH2O2H 
HO2CH2OCHO OCH2OCHO N NO N2O 
NO2 NH NH2 NH3 HNO 
HONO H2NO NNH N2H2 N2H4
CH3NO2 CH2NH OCHO
END




REACTIONS MOLES CAL/MOLE
!--------------------------H2-O2  MECHANISM------------------------------------!
!R1                                                                            !
! Baulch 2005 A/2.065E+14 error (+/-0.1-0.2) 800-3500 K
O2+H=OH+O    1.8E14 -0.097 1.503E4
